<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textrm{ODE}_{t}\left(\textrm{ODE}_{l}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ODE</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mtext>ODE</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textrm{ODE}_{t}\left(\textrm{ODE}_{l}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>: Shortcutting the Time and Length in Diffusion and Flow Models for Faster Sampling</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
