<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>ImageNet-256 experiments with DiT-XL</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#A1.T6" title='Table 6 ‣ Appendix A ImageNet-256 experiments with DiT-XL ‣ "ODE"_𝑡⁢("ODE"_𝑙): Shortcutting the Time and Length in Diffusion and Flow Models for Faster Sampling' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> (top), we provide a comparison to recent diffusion models on ImageNet-256 dataset with a large NFE budget <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>. In Table <a href="#A1.T6" title='Table 6 ‣ Appendix A ImageNet-256 experiments with DiT-XL ‣ "ODE"_𝑡⁢("ODE"_𝑙): Shortcutting the Time and Length in Diffusion and Flow Models for Faster Sampling' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> (bottom), we also report results with the DiT-XL network for the time-wise shortcut model (SM) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite> and <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textrm{ODE}_{t}\left(\textrm{ODE}_{l}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ODE</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mtext>ODE</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textrm{ODE}_{t}\left(\textrm{ODE}_{l}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> including the SM reference results and our experimental results with variable NFE budget <math id="A1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T\in\{128,4,1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>128</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T\in\{128,4,1\}</annotation></semantics></math>. We finetune our model using approximately 43 epochs (200,000 iterations with batch size of 256 as specified in Table <a href="#A1.T7" title='Table 7 ‣ Appendix A ImageNet-256 experiments with DiT-XL ‣ "ODE"_𝑡⁢("ODE"_𝑙): Shortcutting the Time and Length in Diffusion and Flow Models for Faster Sampling' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>) from the SM public checkpoint to avoid a very long training with 250 epochs. Table <a href="#A1.T6" title='Table 6 ‣ Appendix A ImageNet-256 experiments with DiT-XL ‣ "ODE"_𝑡⁢("ODE"_𝑙): Shortcutting the Time and Length in Diffusion and Flow Models for Faster Sampling' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> (bottom) shows that <math id="A1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textrm{ODE}_{t}\left(\textrm{ODE}_{l}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ODE</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mtext>ODE</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textrm{ODE}_{t}\left(\textrm{ODE}_{l}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> scales well compared to the SM baseline. For example, memory and/or latency can be reduced with a minor drop in FID when the length <math id="A1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math> is selected to be 20 out of 28 DiT-XL blocks.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span><span id="A1.T6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ImageNet-256 experiments with DiT-XL and comparison to recent diffusion models.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T6.4.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.4.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">Model</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">FID</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="3"><math id="A1.T6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> time steps</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="2">Param. count</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="2">Train. epochs</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_border_tt"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.4.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.4.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">DiT-XL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite></td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">2.3</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="3">500</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="2">675M</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="2">640</td>
